A '''city''' was located on the [[planet]] [[Oba Diah]], situated near the [[Pyke Palace|fortress]] of the [[Pyke Syndicate]]. After [[Escape from Oba Diah|escaping]] [[Prison|imprisonment]] from within the [[Pyke]]s' fortress, [[Ahsoka Tano]] and [[Rafa Martez|Rafa]] and [[Trace Martez]] were pursued through the [[city]].<ref name="Dangerous Debt" />

